    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581470/extras/ffa8ebb78e2edda45e2265738d09a6ab.webp?t=1638205841\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581470/extras/16773988860b55cb2d9ba98731ec6744.webp?t=1638205841\" /></div><br><strong>A single-player third-person adventure set in the Eastern Icelandic tundra, where you must brave not only the cold, but the spirits that wander the night.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><strong>Play notes. Fight ghosts.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581470/extras/c588847140d6f5319b269dc53e0ac53c.avif?t=1638205841\" /></div><br>Playing her harmonica, Haru can ward off evil ghosts and make friends with benevolent spirits that rise in the darkness.<br><br><strong>Breathtaking graphics.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581470/extras/33b00a4d30d6d58474e1eb6623b40273.avif?t=1638205841\" /></div><br>With a built in &quot;photo mode,&quot; you can take cinematic-quality screenshots of your adventure.<br><br><strong>Pet the cat.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581470/extras/ff57fb37533b44b6abf4a093d0bd4167.avif?t=1638205841\" /></div><br>Yes, you <strong>CAN</strong> pet the cat!<br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581470/extras/b3343f23f1d680d6826368a9d44f2f90.avif?t=1638205841\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A game by Sheehan Ahmed and Weston Bell-Geddes</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581470/extras/53aefcf0f5a36bfbefd116ead5a2a9f4.avif?t=1638205841\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581470/extras/ffa8ebb78e2edda45e2265738d09a6ab.webp?t=1638205841\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581470/extras/16773988860b55cb2d9ba98731ec6744.webp?t=1638205841\" /></div><br><strong>A single-player third-person adventure set in the Eastern Icelandic tundra, where you must brave not only the cold, but the spirits that wander the night.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><strong>Play notes. Fight ghosts.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581470/extras/c588847140d6f5319b269dc53e0ac53c.avif?t=1638205841\" /></div><br>Playing her harmonica, Haru can ward off evil ghosts and make friends with benevolent spirits that rise in the darkness.<br><br><strong>Breathtaking graphics.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581470/extras/33b00a4d30d6d58474e1eb6623b40273.avif?t=1638205841\" /></div><br>With a built in &quot;photo mode,&quot; you can take cinematic-quality screenshots of your adventure.<br><br><strong>Pet the cat.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581470/extras/ff57fb37533b44b6abf4a093d0bd4167.avif?t=1638205841\" /></div><br>Yes, you <strong>CAN</strong> pet the cat!<br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581470/extras/b3343f23f1d680d6826368a9d44f2f90.avif?t=1638205841\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A game by Sheehan Ahmed and Weston Bell-Geddes</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581470/extras/53aefcf0f5a36bfbefd116ead5a2a9f4.avif?t=1638205841\" /></div>",
    "short_description": "Night falls. Spirits rise. Some are friendly, and some are not. Journey into the Icelandic wilderness as Haru, a young girl searching for her lost sister. Play your harmonica to ward off ghosts looming over the forest. Experience a hauntingly beautiful story of trust, fear, and determination.",
